	(descr "GCT (formerly GradConn) RFPC-SMA28-F SMA jack (female), straight, through-hole, 50 ohm. Centre pin 1.55 mm drill / 2.325 mm pad; four ground posts on a 5.08 mm square, 1.75 mm drill / 2.625 mm pad (the TinkerNav V25 land for the same part). Flange 7.0 x 7.0 mm, 9.6 mm above the seating plane, posts 3.9 mm below it. Pin 1 = centre, pin 2 = posts, as Connector:Conn_Coaxial. https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/gct/RFPC-SMA28-F/22162141")
